{"completion":"{\"decision\":\"no_change\",\"direction\":\"none\",\"edits\":[],\"sourceNodeIds\":[]}","decision":"no_change","groupId":"train-ffc97ef8b70d","id":"train-ffc97ef8b70d-no_change","prompt":"你是规划演化器。G_plan 是旧规划，G_exec 是一次执行后的工作流。\n任务目标及验收由 task 给出，observations 是有限的可见验收样本，不是全部未来任务。\nsource 节点读取数据；filter 保留 quality>=minimum；scale 将 value 乘 factor；\ndedup 按 key 去重且保留第一行；aggregate 按 method(sum/count/mean)聚合 value；identity 原样传递。\n每个非 source 节点必须恰有一个输入。task.outputNodeId 指定交付节点。\n方向只能 plan_toward_verified_exec。执行失败、取消或验收证据不足时必须 abstain。\n从候选 catalog 选择具体 edits，保持其 op、前置条件和目标值原样；不要复制执行的 output/status。\n只学习满足任务验收且不破坏观察样本的最低代价改动；代价=set_param:1,边:2,节点:3。\n旧规划已满足时 no_change。无法给出可信改动时 abstain。sourceNodeIds 是所选改动的上游前沿，\n只表示此候选空间内的干预位置，不能声称真实因果已被证明。多点修复可以有多个源。\n仅输出 JSON：{\"decision\":\"adopt|no_change|abstain\",\"direction\":\"plan_toward_verified_exec|none\",\n\"sourceNodeIds\":[],\"edits\":[]}。不得输出解释。\nINPUT={\"G_exec\":{\"edges\":[[\"n810\",\"n908\"],[\"n810\",\"n174\"],[\"n247\",\"n720\"],[\"n720\",\"n826\"],[\"n174\",\"n247\"]],\"nodes\":[{\"id\":\"n174\",\"op\":\"filter\",\"params\":{\"minimum\":5}},{\"id\":\"n247\",\"op\":\"dedup\",\"params\":{\"key\":\"id\"}},{\"id\":\"n720\",\"op\":\"scale\",\"params\":{\"factor\":6}},{\"id\":\"n908\",\"op\":\"scale\",\"params\":{\"factor\":9}},{\"id\":\"n810\",\"op\":\"source\",\"params\":{}},{\"id\":\"n826\",\"op\":\"aggregate\",\"params\":{\"method\":\"sum\"}}]},\"G_plan\":{\"edges\":[[\"n810\",\"n908\"],[\"n810\",\"n174\"],[\"n247\",\"n720\"],[\"n720\",\"n826\"],[\"n174\",\"n247\"]],\"nodes\":[{\"id\":\"n174\",\"op\":\"filter\",\"params\":{\"minimum\":5}},{\"id\":\"n247\",\"op\":\"dedup\",\"params\":{\"key\":\"id\"}},{\"id\":\"n720\",\"op\":\"scale\",\"params\":{\"factor\":6}},{\"id\":\"n908\",\"op\":\"scale\",\"params\":{\"factor\":1}},{\"id\":\"n810\",\"op\":\"source\",\"params\":{}},{\"id\":\"n826\",\"op\":\"aggregate\",\"params\":{\"method\":\"sum\"}}]},\"catalog\":[{\"after\":9,\"before\":1,\"field\":\"factor\",\"nodeI